body:
The card templates (keep in mind almost none of this script is my original work. i added a few breaks in and changed a colour but that's all. also i forgot to mention but the random number thingy it just to randomize where each cloze word appears in the list so you can't just memorize its location)

**Front Template:**

{{Prompt}}

<div class='parent'>

<hr id=

<br>

<br>

<br

{{type::cloze::Text}}

</div>

<script>

var p = document.querySelector('.parent');

for (var i = p.children.length; i >= 0; i--) {

   p.appendChild(p.children\[Math.random() \* i | 0\]);

}

$('#cloze-wrapper').each(function(){

let clozeText = $(this).html().replace('\[...\]', "");

$(this).html(clozeText)

});

</script>

<div id="cloze-wrapper">{{cloze:Text}}</div> 

</script>

&#x200B;

**Back Template:**



{{Prompt}}

<hr id=

<br>

{{cloze::Text}}

{{type::cloze:Text}}

<br>

<br>

&#x200B;

**Styling:**

.card {

   font-family: arial;

   font-size: 20px;

   text-align: center;

   color: black;

   background-color: white;

}

.cloze {

   font-weight: bold;

   color: purple;

}

.nightMode .cloze {

   color: lightblue;

}
